sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Dispatcher as Dispatcher
    participant Agent as LangGraph Orchestrator
    participant MCTS as Grounded LATS / ToT Engine
    participant Env as Grounded Live DB Environment
    participant MCP as FastMCP Tools
    participant DB as PostgreSQL DB

    Dispatcher->>Agent: Operational Shock: "SPR-3001 broken down + 18 km/h wind gusts on Northern Fields"
    Agent->>MCP: Get live fleet status & active jobs
    MCP->>DB: SELECT * FROM Equipment; SELECT * FROM Dispatch_Jobs WHERE status='pending'
    DB-->>MCP: Fleet snapshot (SPR-3001 down, SPR-3002 idle, Field 4 wind=18km/h)
    MCP-->>Agent: Structured fleet state
    
    Agent->>MCTS: Search candidate reshuffle plans (Monte Carlo Tree Search with Grounded DB feedback)
    loop MCTS Iterations
        MCTS->>MCTS: Propose Candidate Schedule Permutation
        MCTS->>Env: Evaluate candidate against Live DB + Weather + Buffer rules
        Env->>DB: Verify equipment availability, technician certification, soil compaction
        Env-->>MCTS: Grounded Feedback Score (0.0 - 1.0) + violation details
        MCTS->>MCTS: Backpropagate value & accumulate reflection notes
    end
    MCTS-->>Agent: Optimal Validated Schedule (Score: 0.94)

    Agent->>Agent: Self-Refine & Critic pass (Verify complete work orders)
    Agent-->>Dispatcher: Present full Day Schedule Reshuffle with impact analysis & 1-click execution button
